      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I will contact splinks directly on this as i've now tested and it does work.. however.. it causes a jitter when you are on the chair constantly which actually lowers your fps. Its not the animation of sitting.. it is related to the configurable joint directly, i will do some more testing as im desperate to get this working..",
