      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bea3f0079d3255f1867f21e|full_name}: Hey, been away from home so I can't access my normal Unity stuff so I haven't been able to test again more thoroughly.  What configurable joint are you referring to? \n\nI tried reverse engineering it to get a minimum viable solution and it didn't have a config joint in it; just the chair and the animator overrides that are included in his package.  (along with some overrides for the sitting emotes, etc)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
